<Slide style={{width: '1280px', height: '720px', background: '#FFFFFF', padding: '0px', fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei'}}><Box style={{position: 'absolute', top: 0, left: 0, width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#FFFFFF'}}></Box><Box style={{position: 'absolute', top: 100, left: 60, width: 400, gap: 6}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#3D7BD9', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'left' }}>CHAPTER</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 156, color: '#D6E4F7', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'left' }}>02</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#8B97A8', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.26, textAlign: 'left' }}>问题 · 方法 · 机制</Text></Box><Box style={{position: 'absolute', top: 132, left: 480, width: 740, gap: 17}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 37, color: '#0E3F8C', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'left' }}>方法：两阶段分层与滚动闭环</Text><Box style={{width: 740, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 11, alignItems: 'center'}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#1E4FA8', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'left' }}>01</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 22, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.3, textAlign: 'left' }}>方法分三层：选择（哪些任务）→ 分配（谁执行 / 何顺序 / 何巢）→ 滚动（跨周期状态）</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 740, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 11, alignItems: 'center'}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#1E4FA8', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'left' }}>02</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 22, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.3, textAlign: 'left' }}>第一阶段轻量缩空间，不构造成全局组合优化问题</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 740, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 11, alignItems: 'center'}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#1E4FA8', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'left' }}>03</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 22, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.3, textAlign: 'left' }}>第二阶段把 y / x / π / z 放进同一框架精优化，外层滚动继承状态</Text></Box><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#8B97A8', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.3, textAlign: 'left' }}>导览：P7 · 总体框架　　P8 · 第一阶段　　P9 · 滚动闭环</Text></Box><Box style={{position: 'absolute', top: 588, left: 480, width: 740, background: '#F0F5FC', paddingLeft: 15, justifyContent: 'center'}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#0E3F8C', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.26, textAlign: 'left' }}>核心主张：快速任务选择缩空间 + 精细组合优化 + 滚动状态继承。</Text></Box></Slide>